	["Optional, and it saves every later trip to {npc:12944} the Ring of Law fight. {npc:8888} is a ghost in the middle of {area:1445}: only the dead see him, so die in the mountain and walk to his tomb as a spirit. He sends you after {npc:9056} in {area:1584}, who always drops {item:10999}; place it on {npc:8888}'s monument in the Shrine of Thaurissan and the {item:11000} falls out. {area:1584} is a five-player dungeon: group up."] = "可选，完成后每次再去找 {npc:12944} 都能省去秩序竞技场的战斗。{npc:8888} 是 {area:1445} 中央的幽灵：只有死者能看见他，因此先在山内死去，再以灵魂状态走到他的墓前。他会让你去找 {area:1584} 的 {npc:9056}，后者必定掉落 {item:10999}；把它放在索瑞森神殿中 {npc:8888} 的纪念碑上，就会掉出 {item:11000}。{area:1584} 是五人地下城：请组队。",
